        win.deadlines.individual.toISOString().slice(0, 10) + "; with a company partner or member the return is due on the first anniversary of the period end (TMA 1970 s.12AA(5B) and s.12ABA(4)(b)) and could be amended until " +
        win.deadlines.company.toISOString().slice(0, 10) + ". Today falls between the two, so it is not treated as open (confirm who the partners are, and the exact statutory filing date, with your accountant)";
    if(!win || !win.known) return null;
    var text = describeKnownWindow(s, win);
    if(win.member === "company" && win.memberDate === "company")
      return text + "; a partner or LLP member is a company, so the partnership return is due on the first anniversary of the period end (TMA 1970 s.12AA(5B) and s.12ABA(4)(b)) and can be amended for twelve months after that, until " + win.deadline.toISOString().slice(0, 10) + " - a later filing date under s.12AA(5C), which applies only where the notice to file came more than nine months after the period end, is not assumed";
